mode: "100644"
text: "# AGYOS Brand & Visual Assets\n\nThis directory contains the canonical vector branding assets for AGYOS.\n\n## Master Logo\n\n- **File**: `assets/agyos-logo.svg`\n- **Format**: Scalable Vector Graphics (SVG 1.1)\n- **Design Motif**: Dark futuristic HUD geometry with an energetic cyan/blue core nucleus, layered orbital rings, coordinate crosshairs, and bold AGYOS typography with a glowing status indicator.\n- **Color Palette**:\n  - Background: Obsidian Deep (`#090D16`, `#040711`)\n  - Accent Cyan: Electric Cyan (`#00F0FF`, `#0077FE`)\n  - Border: Cyber Gray (`#1E293B`, `#334155`)\n  - Typography: Pure White (`#F8FAFC`) with Cyan Glow\n\n## Plugin Logos\n\nEach of the 8 AGYOS plugins in `.agents/plugins/*/assets/logo.svg` contains an optimized SVG logo derived from the master vector specification.\n"
